<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 24/25.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 24/25.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for March</p>
<p>24/25 at 1100GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons</p>
<p>to a German mark.</p>
<p>March 24/25  March 21-24</p>
<p> CZK     0.46189	0.45936</p>
<p> DKK     2.09824	2.09804</p>
<p> FIM     2.67918	2.67529</p>
<p> HUF     0.07646	0.0765</p>
<p> JPY     0.11001	0.10961</p>
<p> LTL     3.38231	3.38315</p>
<p> LVL    23.26666     23.25204</p>
<p> RUR     0.00237	0.00237</p>
<p> SEK     1.7707	 1.77021</p>
<p> UAH     7.30771	7.34285</p>
<p> USD    13.5284	13.5292</p>
<p> XEU    15.52722     15.51055</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
